y pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered running state with no failed units, writable root storage, and intact policy files.","limitations":["The fixed lifecycle snapshots independently confirm the reboot and general node health but do not probe usb_storage; module-specific confirmation comes from the captured executor commands.","Two small diagnostic files were left in /tmp after verification."]}
